  <name>QSSTV-Experimental</name>
  <summary>Amateur radio slow-scan television and digital SSTV (DRM)</summary>
  <description>
    <p>QSSTV-Experimental sends and receives amateur radio slow-scan television (SSTV) pictures and digital SSTV over DRM, using your sound card and optionally a rig-control connection.</p>
    <p>It is built upon the original QSSTV by Johan Maes, ON4QZ, and adds new modes, an improved receiver, decoding of recordings from files, and batch operation from the command line.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">qsstv-experimental.desktop</launchable>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/jbdubbs/QSSTV-Experimental</url>
  <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/jbdubbs/QSSTV-Experimental/issues</url>
  <developer id="io.github.jbdubbs">
